{
  "about": "Hand-written, not generated: the captains' live draft rules exist only on the server (firebase/functions/src/tournaments/draft_model.ts, the original, and its port in packages/shared/src/drafts.ts); the app only reads the board. Both copies are checked against these cases. autoPick: the best player left (ties to the lower uid), in a mixed division the best of the gender match the team has fewer of (mmp when even). startProblem and pickProblem: the message, or null. teamsFromDraft: each captain first, then their picks; a captain's team name, or 'Team <captain name>' cut to 80 characters.",
